                <pb facs="0618" n="512" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg512"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Sleeper to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-07-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 21,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(In reply to Department’s cablegram of the 20th, Mr. Sleeper says the matter is
                    fully reported in dispatch 135, mailed this day, and that the alleged outrage is
                    not apparent.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
